-- Las Vegas GP 2026 result: 1 News article (separate small publish; the 22 Nov daily 40 is already live). Max Verstappen (Red Bull) won the 50-lap race in 1:32:45.112, 0.639s ahead of Lando Norris, his 75th career victory; McLaren double podium (Norris 2nd, Piastri 3rd); Antonelli 4th after losing power on the final lap.
-- VERIFIED: facts checked against PlanetF1, RacingNews365, RaceFans, Kursiv and F1Headline. Pole NOT stated (sources disagree: PlanetF1/Kursiv say Verstappen, RaceFans says Antonelli); NO championship points (not verified); NO 2025 details; Russell crash lap NOT stated (RacingNews365 Lap 49 vs Kursiv Lap 48).
-- VERIFIED_DATE: News row, verifiedAt NULL, authorName NULL (Phase 2a rule).
-- SQL SAFETY: bodies are dollar-quoted; title and excerpt contain no apostrophes (checked by builder).

